@@ -5,4 +5,8 @@ a title, a priority and a few tags, tick them off when they are done, and look a
 urgent first. This package holds the list itself, in TypeScript; the app's screens use its public API
 from `src/index.ts`.
 
+Every task includes `createdAt` and `updatedAt` as ISO-8601 date-time strings in UTC. Both are set
+to the same time when the task is added. Completing, reopening, renaming, tagging or untagging a task
+updates `updatedAt` while preserving `createdAt`. Operations that fail or make no change preserve both.
+
 Run its tests with `npm test`.
